        "b": 193.02381400000002
      },
      "content": "5.1.3.7 Power failure compensation",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0836",
      "reading_order": 1122,
      "section": "5.1.3.7 Power failure compensation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 188.0331152,
        "r": 489.59272410000005,
        "b": 178.78033800000003
      },
      "content": "To enter into the function please press the sleep key 10 times with 4 beeps in 7 seconds"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0837",
      "reading_order": 1123,
      "section": "5.1.3.7 Power failure compensation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 172.4752598,
        "r": 547.8644662999998,
        "b": 147.66462720000004
      },
      "content": "Under the power failure compensation mode, unplug and plug again ,the indoor unit will resume original operation"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0838",
      "reading_order": 1124,
      "section": "5.1.3.7 Power failure compensation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 141.35954900000002,
        "r": 533.9537608900015,
        "b": 132.10677180000005
      },
      "content": "Under the power failure compensation mode, unplug and plug again, the unit will be on OFF state."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0839",
      "reading_order": 1125,
      "section": "5.1.3.7 Power failure compensation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 125.80169360000002,
        "r": 547.939378550001,
        "b": 100.99106100000006
      },
      "content": "Mode, Fan speed, Healthy, Set temperature can be memoried. Swing, Timer, Sleep cannot be memoried"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0840",
      "reading_order": 1126,
      "section": "5.1.3.7 Power failure compensation",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 101.777,
        "t": 94.68598280000003,
        "r": 393.01984672000106,
        "b": 85.43320560000006
      },
      "content": "Press the sleep key for 10 times with 2 beeps in 7 seconds to exit."
